            "reviewer_id": "User_p1_0",
            "review_title": "Review at Nhà Bar",
            "review_text": "ngan l\nho chi minh city1 contribution\n1\nTerrible bar in Nha Trang\nFeb 2025 • Friends\nMy friend has been here a few times and the last time he was so drunk that he was charged 3 times for £98 each time, without any receipt??? a few days later we went to ask about the receipt and couldn't find any receipt for £98, and they said the payment information wasn't theirs, but there was no receipt from the bar on the payment history either (one thing for sure my friend always uses his visa card everywhere, and doesn't use cash), so the bar gave him free drinks that night??\nWhen we came to find out, the Vietnamese woman who was said to be the bar owner's wife was very enthusiastic in helping, but when the bar owner, a Swiss man like a \"gangster\" spoke impolitely to us, while we only needed to check the camera again, we would know the truth because there were many cameras inside the bar, but he did not cooperate and even chased us away while we were having drinks at the bar😅. That proves that he knew about the fraud?!\n\nWe also went to Loc Tho Ward Police to report the incident.\n\nI hope that anyone who intends to go to \"\" Nha Bar \"\" thinks and is careful, do not be like my friend🤣\nRead more\nWritten February 16, 2025\njoacim k\nYour drunk friend didn’t pay with card at the bar.\nBut he probably was to wasted to remember that.\nWritten July 16, 2026\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
