            "review_text": "Erin\n4 contributions\n1\nTRIPLE CHECK YOUR BILL!\nDec 2021 • Couples\nAt first, you'll definitely love this bar but as soon as they've noticed that you're already smashed. They'll rip you off! We had 10 nossy flossy but in our bill, we had 14. We tried to explain to them that we know how many nossy floss we had and the manager decided to look through the cctv, the time that we confirmed we're right. She shy away and didn't even apologize to us. We got our refund but it spoiled our night. \n\nPlease, triple check your bill guys. This happened not just once, but twice!!!!\n\nThat is our experience in this bar.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten December 8, 2021",
