            "review_text": "OscarValdepenas\n3 contributions\n0\nPlease double check you bill guys!\nDec 2021 • Couples\nPlease always double check you bill guys. This pub will rip you off for sure if you aren't aware of what you consumed. So had an experience here consumed dozen of laughing gas. We were sure that we only consumed dozenbut they added 2 more on our bill. So please if ever you'll come in this pub please have a second look on your bill. What a shame that the owner reviewed the cctv and confirmed the # of what we had but didnt bother to apologize. That pissed me off! So i wont recommend this pub.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten December 8, 2021",
