            "review_text": "Jonathan L\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam5 contributions\n1\nPlace is really beautiful and has potential. But service and staff are another story……\nOct 2021 • Friends\nThe bar has a great concept and really in a great location. The potential of the place is really clean and well maintained. \n\nThe issue is with the staff which seems to have no idea what customer service is. When you come in you’re treated as if you go to any local place, the staff seem to be there to work and not liking their jobs kinda wierd when working in a bar. When it comes to your bill you’re treated like you’re not going to pay which is pretty sad.\n\nThis place has a potential to be a 5 star establishment but needs to have staff that want to serve the customer and have a smile when serving them.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten November 1, 2021",
